<doc id="98173" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=98173" title="George Gershwin">
George Gershwin

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Karya musik Gershwin asring dipun-ginakaken minangka musik latar filem layar lébar lan sérial drama televisi. Kajawi punika, sapérangan lagu ciptaan Gershwin dados lagu &lt;a href="jazz%20standar"&gt;jazz standar&lt;/a&gt;. Penyanyi jazz &lt;a href="Ella%20Fitzgerald"&gt;Ella Fitzgerald&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan penulis aransemen &lt;a href="Nelson%20Riddle"&gt;Nelson Riddle&lt;/a&gt; ngrekam sajumlah lagu ciptaan Gershwin ingkang dipunkemas ing salebeting album &lt;a href="Ella%20Fitzgerald%20Sings%20the%20George%20and%20Ira%20Gershwin%20Songbook"&gt;Gershwin Songbook&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1959"&gt;1959&lt;/a&gt;). Kajawi punika, taksih kathah musisi lan penyanyi sanès ingkang ngrekam karya-karya Gershwin, antawisipun: &lt;a href="John%20Coltrane"&gt;John Coltrane&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Frank%20Sinatra"&gt;Frank Sinatra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Billie%20Holiday"&gt;Billie Holiday&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Miles%20Davis"&gt;Miles Davis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Herbie%20Hancock"&gt;Herbie Hancock&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Judy%20Garland"&gt;Judy Garland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nina%20Simone"&gt;Nina Simone&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="John%20Fahey%20%28pemusik%29"&gt;John Fahey&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sting"&gt;Sting&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
George Gershwin miyos minangka Jacob Gershowitz wonten ing &lt;a href="Brooklyn"&gt;Brooklyn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;. Tiyang sepuhipun inggih punika imigran keturunan Yahudi saking &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;. Bapakipun, Morris (Moishe) Gershowitz asalipun saking &lt;a href="St.%20Petersburg"&gt;St. Petersburg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampunipun dumunung wonten ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, bapakipun nggantos nama kulawarganipun dados Gershwin. Morris Gershwin palakrama kaliyan imigran asal &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, Rosa Bruskin ingkang miyosaken George.
Wonten ing taun &lt;a href="1916"&gt;1916&lt;/a&gt;, Gershwin wiwit kerja kanggé parusahan Aeolian lan Standard Music Rolls. Pedamelanipun ngrekam lan nyerat aransemèn kanggé &lt;a href="piano%20roll"&gt;piano roll&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika kerja kanggé kekalih parusahan mau, piyambakipun ngasilaken lusinan utawi malah atusan piano roll kanthi migunaken nama asli utawi sesinglon (antawisipun Fred Murtha utawi Bert Wynn). Gershwin ugi ngrekam piano roll ingkang ngemu lagu ciptaanipun nalika kerja kanggé &lt;a href="Welte-Mignon"&gt;Welte-Mignon&lt;/a&gt;. Parusahan mau kerja dhedhasar pesenan saking &lt;a href="M.%20Welte%20%26amp%3B%20Sons%2C%20Inc."&gt;M. Welte &amp; Sons, Inc.&lt;/a&gt; ingkang minangka pancipta lan produsèn pisanan &lt;a href="pianola"&gt;pianola&lt;/a&gt;. Kajawi kerja ngrekam piano roll, Gershwin naté tampil minangka juru main piano ing panggung &lt;a href="vaudeville"&gt;vaudeville&lt;/a&gt; ngiringi &lt;a href="Nora%20Bayes"&gt;Nora Bayes&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Louise%20Dresser"&gt;Louise Dresser&lt;/a&gt;.
Wonten ing taun &lt;a href="1924"&gt;1924&lt;/a&gt;, George lan Ira sesarengan nyerat komèdi musikal &lt;a href="Lady%20Be%20Good%20%28musical%29"&gt;Lady Be Good&lt;/a&gt;. Lagu-lagu saking komèdi musikal punika samangké kathah ingkang dados lagu jazz standar, kados "&lt;a href="Fascinating%20Rhythm"&gt;Fascinating Rhythm&lt;/a&gt;" lan "&lt;a href="The%20Man%20I%20Love%20%28song%29"&gt;The Man I Love&lt;/a&gt;". Taksih wonten ing taun ingkang sami, Gershwin nyerat komposisi musik klasikipun ingkang pisanan, &lt;a href="Rhapsody%20in%20Blue"&gt;Rhapsody in Blue&lt;/a&gt; kanggé piano lan orkèstra. Aransemèn dipunserat déning &lt;a href="Ferde%20Grof%C3%A9"&gt;Ferde Grofé&lt;/a&gt;, déné pertunjukan perdana dipunsamektakaken band &lt;a href="Paul%20Whiteman"&gt;Paul Whiteman&lt;/a&gt; asal New York. Lagu Rhapsody in Blue samangké dados lagu ciptaan Gershwin ingkang paling kondhang ing jagad.
Karya George lan Ira salajengipun inggih punika musikal kanthi judhul &lt;a href="Oh%2C%20Kay%21"&gt;Oh, Kay!&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1926"&gt;1926&lt;/a&gt;), Funny Face (&lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt;), Strike Up the Band (&lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt; &amp; &lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt;), lan Girl Crazy (&lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt;) ingkang ngemu lagu kondhang "I Got Rhythm" lan &lt;a href="Of%20Thee%20I%20Sing"&gt;Of Thee I Sing&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1931"&gt;1931&lt;/a&gt;). Komèdi musikal Girl Crazy inggih punika komèdi musikal pisanan ingkang pikantuk &lt;a href="Penghargaan%20Pulitzer"&gt;Penghargaan Pulitzer&lt;/a&gt;. Lagu "I Got Rhythm" dados lagu &lt;a href="jazz%20standar"&gt;jazz standar&lt;/a&gt;, déné &lt;a href="progresi%20kord"&gt;progresi kord&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing lagu punika gadhah prabawa ageng wonten ing perkembangan musik &lt;a href="jazz"&gt;jazz&lt;/a&gt;. Ewahaning kord kados ingkang wonten "I Got Rhythm" dipunsebut "&lt;a href="rhythm%20changes"&gt;rhythm changes&lt;/a&gt;" lan asring dipunsebut-sebut wonten ing literatur jazz.
Ing wiwitan taun &lt;a href="1937"&gt;1937&lt;/a&gt;, Gershwin wiwit rumaos asring sakit mustakanipun saéngga ngantos boten saged ningali, lan ngraos piyambakipun asring nggandha karèt kobong. Tanpa wonten ingkang mangertosi, tumor ganas ing polo Gershwin sasmsaya parah. Gershwin dhawah nalika saweg nindakaken ilustrasi musik kanggé filem &lt;a href="The%20Goldwyn%20Follies"&gt;The Goldwyn Follies&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt;. Usaha nylametaken kanthi operasi siya-siya, Gershwin tilar donya &lt;a href="11"&gt;11&lt;/a&gt; Juli]] &lt;a href="1937"&gt;1937&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing yuswa 38 taun.
